  * Folds (review 16260): the bake loader models systemd-sysctl's
    effective-value semantics (normalized-key table — exact
    sysctl_normalize first-separator rule, later line wins, bare
    negative-match directives suppress — globs refused) and dies below
    1440 instead of substring-matching the key; the .deb installs the
