    description lookup, and cmdtree LookupDesc's config-mode path
    falls back to it for set/delete/activate/deactivate/show/edit.
    ConfigTopLevel's `set` is description-only; a regrowth test pins
    that no verb re-grows config-grammar descendants. Canonicalize
    never read ConfigTopLevel (all production calls pass
    OperationalTree), so acceptance/authz behavior is unchanged —
    help-text provenance only.

xpf (0.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Stamp the applied-config marker through two UnderSem helpers:
    stampActiveAppliedIfConvergedUnderSem and
