xpf (0.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add the Phase-A schemaNode invariant census (#16163): a test walks
    every node in setSchema (1882 unique) and asserts the documented
    field-combination invariants plus the enum-example census, with a
    shrink-only allow-list (10 reasoned entries) for the initial
